Restrict explicit WHERE path and environment-variable searches to the
specified directories. On Windows a file only in the current directory
does not satisfy /Q C:\Scope:name. At 4fbbefd614b WhereFindByDirs
prepends the current directory even for an explicit scope. Preserve the
implicit current-directory search for an unqualified pattern.
On the same installed x64 guest, the explicit directory, $QADIR:, $PATH:
and quiet not-found cases changed to match Windows; default lookup still passed (5/5).

